    gmeow:useWhen "Use to enforce complete condition coverage for a conclusive positive goal judgment."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid certifying a goal by selecting only the easiest condition or omitting its condition keys."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Retain each actual condition key and its configured verifier; keep incomplete evaluations explicitly incomplete."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Coverage constrains the supplied judgment; it does not execute conditions or infer their truth."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:CompletedGoalConditionCoverageConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:hasSatisfactionCondition ."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:hasSatisfactionCondition ;
    logic:message "A completed satisfied evaluation of a goal with source conditions retains every condition's key and a matching verifier of that same goal, so omitting a configured condition cannot evade its evidence obligation."@x-gmeow-english ;
